#   lsm -> LANDSEA (nivel 1)
#   ci -> SEAICE (nivel 1)
#   sdwe -> SNOW (nivel 1)
#   sde -> SNOWH (nivel 1)
#   st,soilw,soill -> nivel 106 (capas de suelo)
#   pt,t,u,v,gh -> niveles 6 (max wind) y 7 (tropopause)
